7840 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Dear Bro\056 C\056 James White\054 You are one\054 whom I longed to see in my life after hearing the songs produced by you on the \034Holy Sabbath\035 in Tamil language in the year 1999\054 a marvelous and commendable work which no one else have done in the past or now\056 It is a production found to be fearfully and theologically written and wonderfully made\056\056\056 I understand that God had called you for this purpose\056 You have covered the entire history of the Sabbath in 10 songs from Eden to Eden with more than 14 top singers\056 I also use to often think that \034I AM YOUR FAN\035 to that extent your songs have touched my heart and impressed that reminds our Creator God\056 I wanted to tell you\054 I have not at all heard all in my life such a meaningful songs produced on Sabbath\056\056\056 I can see\054 you have been called by God for an important ministry in India\056 I know Satan will not allow you and he will work to even destroy you and all your efforts\056 But remember brother\054 God is with you and He will give you the strength \056\056\056 Never be discouraged\056\056\056)
     /K [ 49 ]
     /P 7841 0 R
     /Pg 7742 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

