  << /ActualText (\034Though you are not a pastor or holding any capacity in the CMC in India\054 you have been doing more for the Lord independently\056 But still you have the vision and desire for doing great ministry to the Lord\056 Your books\054 \034The Antichrist\035 and \034The Sanctuary Made Simple\035 published in English\054 Tamil and Kannada had impressed me and many others\056 All my friends and church members are very much impressed and strengthened by the great messages you had brought out through the 10 songs of your album\054 \034Holy Sabbath\035\056 And you are one known by the album on Sabbath\056 Also\054 I have been telling and encouraging you in your difficulties you have been undergoing it is because Satan is dead against you of all your production\056 Never get discouraged or panic and be assured that you are in our prayers\056 From the bottom of my heart\054 I sincerely appreciate your greatest challenging work for the Lord\056 Indeed and in fact you are the only out comer of bringing the greatest truth of Ten Commandments and the light of Sabbath in music to the world\056\035\050)
