7920 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Dear brother James White\054 You know I am from a very strong orthodox Roman Catholic family\056\056\056 I began to search for the love and truth of God\056 I was very curious that part of my life to find the real church and know the real truth\054 looking into many churches around me\056 I went around asking many and attended many meetings searching and no one gave me the correct answer and I did not see anyone follow the God\047s word\056 At that time in the year 2004\054 my uncle Mr\056 Solomon gave me the books you printed on Antichrist and Sanctuary Service in Tamil language and also the \034Holy Sabbath\035 gospel album you produced in Tamil\056 The Sabbath album and the books of you have done great miracle in my personal life\054 which is a real testimony\056 I learnt and understood from your books which is the true church and also the truth and importance of keeping the 7th day Sabbath from the 10 songs you produced and not the Sunday\056 From then on I began to be associated with the Remnant church\056 I thank God for my uncle Mr\056 Solomon and you for showing me the way and it is all your work that helped me find Jesus Christ and His last true church\056 God touched me and I found the real life in Christ because of your work and got baptized in the year 2005\056 Your songs have touched my heart more and I have shared with many of my friends\054 relatives and whom all I know and I come across\056 Also\054 many and I are very eagerly waiting for the production of the album on Ten Commandments by you\056 Your works are really good and appealing that touches one\031s heart\056 I pray that many be added to the church like me as a result of your ministry\056)
     /K [ 89 ]
     /P 7921 0 R
     /Pg 7742 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

