  << /ActualText (On 14th May 2021 \100 8\07222 p\056m\054 while still on bed with Oxygen support affected of Covid\05519\054 when enquired over phone of his health\054 hurried to tell C\056 James White before disconnecting the call\056\056\056 Rushed to say\056\056\056 \034Sir\054 all of you be safe\056\056\056 Happy Sabbath\056\056\056 Whenever Sabbath comes\054 your thought comes more in me\056\056\056 I cannot forget your songs on Sabbath\056\056\056 Nothing has come so far to overtake your productions\056\056\056 Yours is a high calling ministry\056 Continue to produce more albums like this\056\056\056 Because you did these only\054 Satan had harmed you more\056\056\056 I am praying for you\056\056\056\035)
