7934 0 obj
  << /ActualText (\034Dear Bro\056 C\056 James White\054 I have not seen you so far anytime in person but knew you well more\054 since the year 2010 by the gospel album you produced and released on the topic 7th day Sabbath in Tamil\056 10 songs that covered the history of the entire Sabbath is very much meaningful\054 theological and has won the heart and impressed me and many others of the church\056 I hear your songs on Sabbaths played in homes and churches and have seen people singing special song on Sabbaths and seen more on zoom meetings\056 I can understand people love them more\056 I felt\054 I write this letter to you\054 as to my surprise\054 I heard these Sabbath songs that is purely theological\054 played through loud speakers in other churches on Sundays\054 while I served as pastor at Kannankarai\054 Nagercoil\054 Kanyakumari District\054 Tamil Nadu\056 All knew well that you had spent more on this production just to spread the truth and the message about the 4th Commandment\054 the Bible Sabbath\056 May your desire to even reach the Sunday keepers come true and many accept God\031s true Sabbath and His remnant church\056 We thank you for your wonderful production on the Holy Sabbath brother and anticipate the production of Sabbath video album and your 2nd album on the \034Ten Commandments\035 soon as possible\054 for His glory and many would be redeemed to God\031s kingdom\056 The Spirit of Prophecy promotes music on God\031s Commandments and may it be fulfilled through you\056 Please do it and God will grant you every means\054 blessings and protection from heaven above\054 through His angels and bless the prosperity of your family\054 you and your ministry\056\035 \050)
     /K [ 96 ]
     /P 7935 0 R
     /Pg 7742 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
