7940 0 obj
  << /ActualText (\034Bro\056 James White\054 few months ago you gave me 2 books\054 \034The Antichrist\035 and \034The Sanctuary Made Simple\035\056 After going through these books\054 I found it very essential for the State of Karnataka\054 since we do not have any books on Prophecy in Kannada language\056 Pr\056 Lawrence M\056 Nelson\054 the author has presented these books in a simple and meaningful language\056 I hope and trust these books will prepare many for Christ 2nd coming\056\035 \n\055 Pr\056 J\056 Daniel\056)
