7944 0 obj
  << /ActualText (\034I was thrilled to hear about your plans regarding the putting out an album mainly on the Decalogue and its positive influence\056 As Jesus magnified the Law and made it honorable\054 may your humble attempts through music to focus on the indispensability of the moral law is praiseworthy\056 May the good Lord who helped you complete the production of the first album on the \034Holy Sabbath\035 provide you with adequate financial support in order to complete the present album too\056 I am sure not only the members of God\031s church but also society at large will be benefited by the theme of the song\056\035)
